      "kind": "card",
      "description": "连续正文承载层，阴影不复制到每条事件。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-plane\"><h1>AI 动态</h1><p>从事件流开始，再回查来源与证据。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-plane{font-family:Inter, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;min-width:0;padding:28px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--paper, #fff);color:var(--ink, #10223b);box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(34,61,93,.08)}.ds-plane h1{font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,38px);font-weight:600;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:30ch;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-plane p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted, #5b6d82)}@media(max-width:900px){.ds-plane{padding:16px}.ds-plane h1{margin-bottom:6px}.ds-plane p{margin-bottom:8px}}",
      "refersTo": "home-reading-plane"
    },
    {
      "name": "证据摘录",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "展开后的合成引用示意；真实交互由Vue按钮管理，不在预览中编造执行行为。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-evidence\"><button class=\"ds-evidence-button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"ds-quote\">[2] 合成演示来源</button><blockquote class=\"ds-quote\" id=\"ds-quote\" tabindex=\"-1\">合成段落摘录<footer>段落 demo-p-001 · 来源版本未提供</footer></blockquote></section>",
      "css": ".ds-evidence{font-family:Inter, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink, #10223b);padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line, #d4dee9)}.ds-evidence-button{font-family:Inter, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line, #d4dee9);border-radius:8px;background:var(--paper, #fff);color:var(--ink, #10223b);cursor:pointer}.ds-evidence-button:hover{background:var(--blue-soft, #e8f0fa);border-color:#9cb8d4}.ds-evidence-button:disabled{opacity:.52;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-evidence-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus, #175b95);outline-offset:2px}.ds-quote{margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:#f3f7fb;border-left:1px solid #9db5ca;overflow-wrap:anywhere;animation:ds-reveal .22s ease-out}.ds-quote footer{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted, #5b6d82)}.ds-quote:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus, #175b95);outline-offset:2px}@keyframes ds-reveal{from{clip-path:inset(0 0 100% 0)}to{clip-path:inset(0)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-quote{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}",
      "refersTo": "quote"
    },
    {
      "name": "合成数据提示",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "必须保留完整模式文字。",
      "html": "<p class=\"ds-demo\" role=\"note\">后端合成数据：仅用于界面展示，不代表真实新闻或采集结果。</p>",
      "css": ".ds-demo{font-family:Inter, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;padding:8px 12px;background:#fff8e7;color:#674b00;border:1px solid #f1d396;border-radius:8px}",
      "refersTo": "demo-notice"
    },
    {
      "name": "错误与重试",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "错误含文字与警报语义，不能替换成空结果。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-error\" role=\"alert\">服务未配置或不可用。<button class=\"ds-retry\">重试</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-error{font-family:Inter, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;padding:20px;border:1px solid #e8b5ae;border-radius:14px;background:var(--paper, #fff);color:var(--danger, #a5342b)}.ds-retry{font-family:Inter, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line, #d4dee9);border-radius:8px;background:var(--paper, #fff);color:var(--ink, #10223b);cursor:pointer}.ds-retry:hover{background:var(--blue-soft, #e8f0fa);border-color:#9cb8d4}.ds-retry:disabled{opacity:.52;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-retry:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus, #175b95);outline-offset:2px}",
      "refersTo": "error-card"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "桌面阅读空间 · 云层切面 · 动作谱",
    "overview": "以桌面阅读空间为主体：冷银蓝底面托起白色连续阅读面，深蓝交互与深墨正文建立稳定层级。云层切面只表现为面板、浅色摘录和证据展开的层次；动作谱只表现为日期、节点与正文的对齐节奏。\n\n这是依据已完成 Vue 页面与最终 CSS 层叠提取的实现记录，替代此前青绿色版本。中文工作字体、紧凑 SVG、留白与轻边界支撑日常阅读；没有栅格素材、云景或舞蹈符号。页面组成见方向契约，产品能力边界仍以 PRODUCT.md 为准。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "冷银蓝地面、白色阅读面与安静的上下文面板。",
      "连续事件流采用完整日期和细线节点，移动端回到自然文档顺序。",
      "证据在正文中展开，来源、段落和缺失信息保留明确文字。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Reading Plane Rule",
        "body": "深蓝用于链接、当前导航与主要动作；大面积承载阅读的是白色面与冷银蓝地面。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Date Rhythm Rule",
        "body": "日期必须按正常阅读顺序完整显示；桌面日期列与节点对齐，移动端移到事件组上方。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Evidence Layer Rule",
        "body": "层次服务于阅读与核对：主阅读面使用柔和阴影，摘录使用浅色平面和细边界，不引入字面云景。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 保留合成数据、模拟流、检索范围、覆盖不足与错误的明确文字标识。",
      "Do 为按钮、字段与导航保留至少44px高度及可见焦点；原生分类单选项的当前行高为36px，不能将它当作44px合规证明。",
      "Do 保留日期、统计数字的等宽数字特性，让链接、计划与摘录长文本换行。",
      "Do 让证据展开可由键盘操作，聚焦已展开摘录，并保留来源与段落可用性说明。",
      "Do 使用已实现的平面层次、细线、SVG和中文字体回退，优先让内容可读。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 把服务失败、模拟回答或合成事件呈现成真实成功或真实新闻。",
      "Don't 只靠颜色传达错误、加载、取消或数据来源。",
      "Don't 将云层切面变成云雾、3D场景或图片，将动作谱变成舞蹈符号。",
      "Don't 把连续事件阅读区改成等尺寸摘要卡片墙。",
      "Don't 把尚未完成的真实数据库、模型、历史材料验收或待定审查写成设计合格或产品能力承诺。"
    ]
  }
}
